&CONTROL OFF
&FN = &1
&IF .&FN EQ . &FN = BREXX
&IF .&2 EQ . &SKIP 2
   &TYPE Syntax: &EXEC [fn]
   &EXIT 1
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE
* Build bREXX TEXT deck.
EMIT Creating &FN TEXT for resident loading...
COPYFILE MAIN     TEXT A &FN TEXT A (REPLACE
COPYFILE ABBREV   TEXT A &FN TEXT A (APPEND
COPYFILE ABS      TEXT A &FN TEXT A (APPEND
COPYFILE ADD      TEXT A &FN TEXT A (APPEND
COPYFILE ADDRESS  TEXT A &FN TEXT A (APPEND
